      "v": 11,
      "zh": "那时，必有许多国归附耶和华，作他（原文是我）的子民。他（原文是我）要住在你中间，你就知道万军之耶和华差遣我到你那里去了。",
      "en": "“Many nations will join themselves to the Lord on the day of salvation,[NOTE:1] and they will also be my[NOTE:2] people. Indeed, I will settle in the midst of you all. Then you will know that the Lord of Heaven’s Armies has sent me to you.",
